claim.claim-text:
a plurality of serially-connected modules, wherein each of the modules includes:
a body having an interior volume formed to accommodate a drug vial;
a cannula protruding into the interior volume, the cannula terminating at a free end, first and second openings being formed in the free end with first and second lumens extending therefrom and through the cannula;
a socket located on an exterior portion of the body;
a first passageway extending between, and in communication with, the socket and the first lumen;
a boss protruding from an exterior portion of the body; and,
a second passageway extending from, and in communication with the second lumen, the second passageway extending through the boss to terminate at an exit opening formed therein
